// Audio Device FFI
// Library: audio.device
//
// NOTE: audio.device is purely IORequest-based and has no library functions.
// All operations use standard exec.library device I/O:
// - OpenDevice() to open and allocate channels
// - DoIO() / SendIO() / WaitIO() for commands
// - CloseDevice() to close
//
// Constants are in std::ffi::amiga_consts (ADCMD_*, ADIOF_*, ADIOERR_*)
// Structs are in std::ffi::amiga_structs (IOAudio)
//
// For high-level audio playback, use:
// - std::audio::paula for direct hardware access (games/demos)
// - std::audio::device for OS-friendly playback (applications)
